<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Embratel Q1 net profit down vs year ago.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Embratel Q1 net profit down vs year ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Embratel, a long-distance telephone unit of federally owned Telebras, on Monday released the following the first-quarter 1997 results:</p>
<p>				Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net			54.42 million	   118.76 million</p>
<p>Share Net		 0.01152	     0.025141</p>
<p>Gross Profit	   252.3 million	   214.4 million</p>
<p>Net Revs		 504.6 million	   455.3 million</p>
<p>Pre-Tax Profit	 48.1 million	    131.2 million</p>
<p>Oper Profit	    166.1 million	   135.4 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230361))</p>
